{"name":"Looksminning","deep":true,"image":{"url":"assets/photos/looksminning.webp","credit":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9BSIHvPsDBs","caption":"Looksminning","source":"Used with permission"},"mentions":61,"casual":{"lead":["Looksminning (or looksmin) is looksmax.org slang for anything that lowers how good someone looks, in contrast to looksmaxxing, which raises it. Members use it for habits, features and procedures: a flat back of the head, a neck cyst, a coffee habit, drinking, screens, or exercise styles thought to look awkward.","It works as a way of weighing costs. Someone asks whether a thing is a looksmin before deciding whether to do it, treat it, or accept it. Because the term is informal, there is no research on it as such; threads are opinion and anecdote."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["In practice people post a candidate (a hairstyle limit, a supplement, a medical condition, a workout) and others say how big a looksmin they think it is. Some threads advise avoiding the habit, others describe fixing the feature, for example by haircuts that disguise a flat occiput or surgery for a neck cyst."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["The term itself carries no risk, but advice in these threads is informal and sometimes involves medical conditions or procedures. Several threads concern conditions (a thyroglossal duct cyst, gynecomastia) for which clinicians are the usual source of diagnosis and treatment."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Looksmin 10% of you have - thyroglossal duct cyst","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/looksmin-10-of-you-have-thyroglossal-duct-cyst.1748213/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251227055300/https://looksmax.org/threads/looksmin-10-of-you-have-thyroglossal-duct-cyst.1748213/"},{"title":"Underrated Looksmin: Flat Occipital","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/underrated-looksmin-flat-occipit