 site called looksmin org nutritional or leanmax experts gtfih","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/is-there-an-opposite-site-called-looksmin-org-nutritional-or-leanmax-experts-gtfih.695967/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230607233214/https://looksmax.org/threads/is-there-an-opposite-site-called-looksmin-org-nutritional-or-leanmax-experts-gtfih.695967/"},{"title":"rate this foids looksminning","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/rate-this-foids-looksminning.623168/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221215221522/https://looksmax.org/threads/rate-this-foids-looksminning.623168/"},{"title":"is training traps looksmin","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/is-training-traps-looksmin.617633/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221207220659/https://looksmax.org/threads/is-training-traps-looksmin.617633/"},{"title":"selfies drastically looksmin you you may be more attractive than you think","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/selfies-drastically-looksmin-you-you-may-be-more-attractive-than-you-think.613254/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230609140543/https://looksmax.org/threads/selfies-drastically-looksmin-you-you-may-be-more-attractive-than-you-think.613254/"},{"title":"is there a bigger looksmin than smoking and drinking","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/is-there-a-bigger-looksmin-than-smoking-and-drinking.611811/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221129102126/https://looksmax.org/threads/is-there-a-bigger-looksmin-than-smoking-and-drinking.611811/"},{"title":"at what norwood is it over or a significant looksmin","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/at-what-norwood-is-it-over-or-a-significant-looksmin.609888/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221208024847/https://looksmax.org/threads/at-what-norwood-is-it-over-or-a-significant-looksmin.609888/"},{"title":"does vaping looksmin you","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/does-vaping-looksmin-you.590107/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221022095148/https://looksmax.org/threads/does-vaping-looksmin-you.590107/"},{"title":"palate width ipd looksmin result by mse","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/palate-width-ipd-looksmin-result-by-mse.584852/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221013021158/https://looksmax.org/threads/palate-width-ipd-looksmin-result-by-mse.584852/"},{"title":"rate this looksmin","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/rate-this-looksmin.584421/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221014030239/https://looksmax.org/threads/rate-this-looksmin.584421/"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[]},"angle":{"goal":"Overall look","chain":["Name a flaw or habit that may lower looks","Judge whether it is worth fixing, hiding or accepting","Choose haircuts, treatment or behavior accordingly"],"effect":"indirect","text":"The concept gives members a vocabulary for spotting things that may detract from appearance and for deciding what to do about them, for example choosing a haircut that offsets a flat occiput or seeking removal of a visible neck cyst."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Looksminning, usually shortened to looksmin, is a term used on the looksmax.org forum for anything that is seen as reducing a person's attractiveness, the opposite of looksmaxxing. It is applied both to personal features and to choices or habits, and can also describe weighing a possible downside before a decision [1][2][3].","Threads using the word cover a wide range: a thyroglossal duct cyst in the neck that a poster says affected his side profile [1], a flat back of the head and the haircuts that suit it [2], whether jumping rope in a gym looks awkward [3], and whether coffee, drinking, screens, minoxidil, wisdom tooth extraction or palate expanders count [4][5][6][7][8]. The common thread is a cost-benefit question about looks.","The term is community slang and has no formal definition or research literature."],"infobox":[["Type","Community slang / framework"],["Opposite","Looksmaxxing"],["Forum","looksmax.org"],["Variants","Looksmin, hard looksmin"]],"sections":[{"h":"Usage","paras":["A looksmin is a feature, habit or choice thought to reduce looks. Posters rate it informally, with phrases such as a \"hard looksmin\" for a large downside [4]. Threads ask whether everyday things such as raw milk or screen time belong in the category [5][6].","Some threads ask the question the other way, whether a benefit is worth the looksmin: one asks if drinking is worth it [7] and another debates whether minoxidil is a looksmin or an overhyped aid [8][9]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Examples from the forum","paras":["A poster described a thyroglossal duct cyst, a congenital remnant of the thyroid's embryonic path, saying it affected his neck profile and that he planned to have it removed [1]. Another poster described a flat occiput and said short haircuts fit poorly, recommending a blowout taper or mullet to add back volume [2].","A thread on jump rope asks whether the exercise looks awkward to onlookers while noting its calorie burn [3]. Other threads ask about gynecomastia, wisdom tooth removal and palate expanders [10][11][12]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found. The term is forum slang and has not been studied."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Members use looksmin as a quick label for a possible appearance downside, usually in titled threads asking whether something qualifies [3][4].","claims":[{"claim":"Features like a flat occiput are \"looksmins\" that limit hairstyles","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"A visible neck cyst can lower facial aesthetics","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Looksmin 10% of you have - thyroglossal duct cyst","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/looksmin-10-of-you-have-thyroglossal-duct-cyst.1748213/","source"